    {
      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5399898266265475100\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8C8D.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🌍\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e This summer will see \u003cb\u003ethe largest rollout\u003c/b\u003e of a non-custodial crypto wallet in human history.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5456140674028019486\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29AA1.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e⚡️\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e\u003cb\u003eInstant zero-fee\u003c/b\u003e crypto transactions for over \u003cb\u003ea billion users\u003c/b\u003e are about to become reality.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5235630047959727475\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F928E.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e💎\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e We\u0026#39;re bringing a \u003cb\u003enative\u003c/b\u003e non-custodial \u003cb\u003eGram wallet\u003c/b\u003e to \u003cb\u003eevery Telegram app\u003c/b\u003e! \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5395335069671910047\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8FB3.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🏳️\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e",
